## How to Apply Online for {{ short_name }}

Eligible candidates can follow the step-by-step instructions below to apply online:

1. Visit the official website of **{{ facts.recruiting_authority or notice.authority_name }}** at [{{ facts.apply_online_url or portal_url }}]({{ facts.apply_online_url or portal_url }}).
2. Complete One-Time Registration (OTR) if you are a new user, or log in using your existing registration credentials.
