4. Fill in personal, communication, educational, and post-code details carefully.
5. Upload scanned copies of your recent photograph, signature, and required certificates in the prescribed format.
6. Preview all entered details thoroughly before final submission.
7. Pay the applicable application fee online (if not exempted).
8. Submit the final form and download or print the confirmation page for future reference.

**Important:** Registration alone is not considered a completed application. Candidates must submit the final recruitment form and complete fee payment before the closing deadline.

